              "issue": "LogParserAdapter.parseMessages(at:) calls LogParser.parseMessages(at:) directly (line 58). LogParser is a project-owned enum with only static members. Adding a new parser implementation or swapping parsing behaviour requires modifying LogParserAdapter, not extending it. The Boundary Adapter exception does not apply because the rule requires 'API is not owned by dev', and LogParser is defined in Sources/LogMessage.swift.",
