              "line_end": 218,
              "title": "SessionManager is an untestable final class dependency injected into LogViewerView",
              "issue": "LogViewerView accepts SessionManager as a concrete final class (line 218). SessionManager is final (cannot be subclassed) and instantiates TTYBridge directly inside spawn() without injection (line 19 of SessionManager.swift). The bridge creation strategy cannot be substituted without modifying SessionManager's source.",
              "impact": "LogViewerView's PTY-interactive paths (canSendInput, bridge callbacks, permissionPrompt, askUserQuestionPrompt, planApprovalPrompt) cannot be exercised in tests or previews without a live PTY environment. Adding a different terminal backend requires modifying SessionManager.",
